; DT818_pro_v4 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio + 6 SMART-TP REVERSE hedges
; Generated 2026-05-20 from wfo_hedge_reverse_may16/run_smart_tp_r2.log (R2 extended grid).
; Use with ea/DT818_pro_v4.mq5 (compiled 2026-05-20 with two-stage smart-TP geometry).
;
; PARENT total risk: 6.0% (1.0% x 6 streams). Range filter DISABLED.
;   S1-S3 = MAY9 R1-R3 (PREVIOUS-week WFO), magics 1111/2222/3333
;   S4-S6 = MAY16 R2/R3/R4 (CURRENT-week WFO, R1+R5 dedup-skipped), magics 4444/5555/6666
;   Parent params unchanged from v3.
;
; SMART-TP REVERSE-HEDGE config (from wfo_hedge_reverse_may16/run_smart_tp_r2.log):
;   Direction:    OPPOSITE of parent
;   Order type:   TWO LIMITs per parent SL at parent_entry:
;                   _s1: closes alpha fraction at BE-of-combined-loss
;                   _s2: closes (1-alpha) fraction at profit_mult * combined-loss
;   SL distance:  parent_SL_pts * sl_mult  (per-stream)
;   TP geometry:  tp1_dist = sl_dist * sl_mult / alpha
;                 tp2_dist = sl_dist * sl_mult * profit_mult / (1 - alpha)
;   Validity:     alpha > 1 / (profit_mult + 1)  (winner=0.5 + pm>=2.5 satisfies)
;   Lots:         parent_lots / sl_mult  (risk-equalized)
;   Global expire_minutes = 240   (4h)
;   Global F1 filter      = 1800s (30min cap)
;   Global regime_gate    = off
;   Hedge magics: 8111/8222/8333/8444/8555/8666 (each places TWO sub-orders per SL).
;
; R2 WFO portfolio compare (30pt sim, $10k, 1.0%/stream, 77d, MAY16 window):
;   v2.1 (no-hedge): NP $+73,832, DD 8.91%, NP/DD$ 9.88, PF 1.74, 1608 trades
;   v4 (smart-TP):   NP $+100,646, DD 5.72%, NP/DD$ 15.90, PF 1.68, 2876 trades
;   delta:           NP +$26,814 (+36%), DD -3.19pp (LOWER), NP/DD$ +6.02 (+61% rel)
;   vs v3 R7:        NP -$14,886 (-13%), DD -0.60pp (LOWER), NP/DD$ +1.33 (+9% rel)
;
; Per-stream R2 winners (alpha=0.5 for all, sl_mult & profit_mult per stream):
;   S1: sl_mult=1.0, alpha=0.5, pm=2.5
;   S2: sl_mult=1.0, alpha=0.5, pm=3.0
;   S3: sl_mult=1.2, alpha=0.5, pm=3.5
;   S4: sl_mult=1.0, alpha=0.5, pm=3.0
;   S5: sl_mult=1.0, alpha=0.5, pm=3.0
;   S6: sl_mult=1.0, alpha=0.5, pm=3.0
;
; NOTE: _HEDGE_Sn_RR_Ratio is DECORATIVE in v4 smart-TP mode (EA computes
;       tp1_dist/tp2_dist from sl_mult+alpha+profit_mult). Kept for legacy display.
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; sim default 30pt)

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
_RiskPct=1.0||1.0||1||1.0||1.0||N
_LotMode=1||1||1||1||1||N
TierBase=2000||2000||1||2000||2000||N
LotStep=0.01||0.01||1||0.01||0.01||N
_MaxSpreadPts=60||60||1||60||60||N

; ===== ORB shared params =====
_BrokerGMTOffsetHours=0||0||1||0||0||N  ; DEPRECATED post 2026-05-07 (EA uses TimeGMT)
